{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22503","headline":"东墟晚歇 · 白居易","name":"东墟晚歇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉风冷露萧索天，黄蒿紫菊荒凉田。\n绕冢秋花少颜色，细虫小蝶飞飜飜。\n中有腾腾独行者，手拄渔竿不骑马。\n晚从南涧钓鱼回，歇此墟中白杨下。\n褐衣半故白发新，人逢知我是何人。\n谁言渭浦栖迟客，曾作甘泉侍从臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}